AUDIO: 'hello today I\'ll be showing you how to bring a character from character creator into Animo for this tutorial we\'ll be using one of the default characters in the facial profile menu select the 60 plus blend shape pack and apply it to the character this contains all the'

[00:13] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'shapes that we need for anim motive when you drag and drop this onto your character a little box will pop up make sure to take the do not override eye blinks and jaw'

[00:25] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'open you\'re going to need to make a small change to the jaw open blend ship open your blend ship editor and click the edit blend ships'

[00:37] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'button find your jaw open blend shape and turn the slider up to 100 you\'re going to want to export this as an obj'

[00:49] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'so go to the drop down menu click export obj once you\'ve got your obj click the little pencil beside the jaw open blind'

[01:01] [scene:talk]
